# Loopback venue
#
# Shows:   the market half of the loopback tour — a venue that answers
#          everything a client can do: orders, replaces, cancels and DKs
# Needs:   the loopback sessions, both started. Help > Scenario Examples sets
#          them up, and its "Run the loopback tour" arms this and runs
#          loopback-client in one click
# Watch:   Received Orders and Sent Trades; Market Scripts, one row an order
# Outcome: every order on LOOP-MKT is accepted and filled in two clips a second
#          apart; the first replace of an order is accepted and later ones are
#          refused; cancels are honoured; a disputed trade is re-notified

scenario loopback-venue
on error continue

on order where session_id == 'LOOP-MKT'
    after 100ms ± 20ms
    accept text: 'working'

    when replace and order.orig_cl_ord_id != ''
        reject text: 'one replace per order'
    when replace
        accept
    when cancel
        accept
        stop
    when dk
        renotify
    when error
        log 'venue refused: ${event.text}'

    repeat 2 every 1s
        if order.leaves_qty > 0
            fill qty: CEIL(order.leaves_qty / 2), price: order.price
